            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Inera kwanata Ejakait EDEKE ebe: “Lo ŋes eraun eikor loitiakiata akwap araun airumet kwape ejaatar atekerin atomon kaarei nuka Isirael. Edumuni Yosep akorakineta aarei. ",
          "type": "text",
