              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eikor da anyoun kaŋolol eraun Kasar-enon koikor loka Damasiko, kari naka agolitomei ejai eikor loka Kamat. Ŋol ŋes ewai loka agolitomei. ",
          "type": "text",
