              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kowai lokokide da, kidin Kauran ka Damasiko ka Gilead, ka akwap naka Isirael, eraun Yorodan; itemete ageun koikor loka agolitomei kiton aŋolol nakokide. Ŋol ŋes ewai lokokide.",
          "type": "text",
